@startuml
title Communication Diagram Example

object User
object Alpine
object XState
object Store
object Pricing

User --> Alpine : 1: click add item
Alpine --> XState : 2: shipItem(itemId)
XState --> Store : 3: getItem(itemId)
Store --> XState : 4: definition
XState --> Pricing : 5: calculate(...)
Pricing --> XState : 6: totals/rules
XState --> Alpine : 7: snapshot update
@enduml
